        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5164 Lever With 5006 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern homes would do well to have this ultra sleek Baldwin made leverset on the doors. Constructed out of solid brass, the 5164 Lever with 5006 Rose is available in contemporary finishes and it features concealed mounting screws to insure a minamalistic look. It will fit 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: For Pre-Drilled Doors use <a href=\"/products/baldwin-brass-sleek-leverset-baldwin-5164-5046\"><b>Baldwin 5164 Lever With 5046 Rosette</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5164 Contemporary Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Accessibility Code (ADA) A117.1</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Solid Brass Modern Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5006 Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\" - <b>will NOT cover standard 2-1/8\" bore</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2.58\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy function is handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Sleek Leverset, Baldwin 5164",
                "description": "Baldwin Estate Collection 5164 Lever with 5006 Rosette - Modern homes would do well to have this ultra sleek Baldwin made leverset on the doors. Constructed out of solid brass, the 5164 Lever with 5006 Rose is available in 2 contemporary finishes and it features concealed mounting screws to insure a minamalistic look. It will fit 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
                "keywords": "BAL-5164, Baldwin sleek leversets, baldwin 5164 levers, baldwin 5006 roses, baldwin 5006 roses, solid brass leversets, contemporary levers, contemporary levesets, baldwin 5164 leversets, baldwin 5006 rosettes, baldwin estates collections, baldwin modern levers, ada compliant levers, Baldwin Estates Collection 5164 Lever With 5006 Rosette,"
